---
description: Mandatory end-of-task git commit and sync procedure
alwaysApply: true
---

At the end of every coding task, follow the permanent Git Commit and Sync Rule in `automation/GIT_COMMIT_SYNC_RULE.md` (authoritative; read it). Never use `git add -A` or `python -m automation github sync`. Its safety rules and any task-specific "do not commit" instruction override it.
